l headers since it\'s meant to be part of a role.\n\nNow, I\'ll ensure that the YAML syntax is correct, using proper indentation and structure. Each task will be a list under the main.yml file, starting with \'---\' as required.\n\nFinally, I\'ll double-check that all variables are correctly referenced and that the handlers are properly notified when needed. This should result in a valid playbook that meets all the user\'s specifications.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Import assertion tasks\n  import_tasks: assert.yml\n  when: true\n\n- name: Install prerequisites\n  apt:\n    name: "{{ vault_prerequisites }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Include installation method specific tasks\n  include_tasks: "{{ vault_installation_method }}.yml"\n\n- name: Add Vault environment variables\n  template:\n    dest: /etc/vault.d/vault.env\n    mode: 0644\n    content: "{{ vault_environment_settings }}"\n  notify: Restart vault\n\n- name: Include hardening tasks\n  include_tasks: hardening.yml\n\n- name: Start and enable vault (for OSS type)\n  service:\n    name: vault\n    state: started\n    enabled: yes\n  when: vault_type == "oss"\n\n- name: Enable vault (for non-OSS type)\n  service:\n    name: vault\n    state: started\n    enabled: yes\n  when: vault_type != "oss"\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-19T15:39:15.042718399Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 12302246095, 'load_duration': 92576773, 'prompt_eval_count': 473, 'prompt_eval_duration': 113362781, 'eval_count': 711, 'eval_duration': 12095407819, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--6b93d118-d065-449a-88af-261c51afefeb-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 473, 'output_tokens': 711, 'total_tokens': 1184}
