's not version 6.\n\nFinally, Task 7: Updating with zypper. Similar to other update tasks, I used zypper\'s \'update\' command to get the latest versions, ensuring it\'s done without unnecessary changes.\n\nThroughout, I made sure each task was correctly ordered and adhered to the user\'s specifications. I also ensured that each task used the correct modules and parameters, avoiding any additional steps or comments as per the instructions.\n</think>\n\n```\n---\n- name: Import assert.yml\n  import_tasks: assert.yml\n  delegate_to: localhost\n  when: false\n\n- name: Configure apk\n  apk:\n    cmd: upgrade\n    cache: true\n    state: present\n  changed_when: false\n\n- name: Configure apt\n  apt:\n    upgrade: none\n    state: present\n    force_apt_get: yes\n  changed_when: false\n\n- name: Update all software (dnf)\n  dnf:\n    name: \'*\'\n    state: latest\n    exclude: chrony,ntp\n    update_cache: yes\n\n- name: Update all software (pacman)\n  pacman:\n    sync: all\n    latest: yes\n    update_cache: yes\n\n- name: Configure yum\n  apt:\n    name: yum\n    state: present\n    when: ansible_distribution_version < "6"\n  yum:\n    name: yum-utils\n    state: present\n    when: ansible_distribution_version < "6"\n  dnf:\n    name: \'*\'\n    state: latest\n    when: ansible_distribution_version >= "6"\n\n- name: Update all software (zypper)\n  zypper:\n    name: \'*\'\n    state: latest\n    update_cache: yes\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-19T16:22:40.610658784Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 16461049108, 'load_duration': 86147602, 'prompt_eval_count': 451, 'prompt_eval_duration': 133741531, 'eval_count': 787, 'eval_duration': 16239864417, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--0e9c76d8-2a97-458f-8365-1b985be80176-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 451, 'output_tokens': 787, 'total_tokens': 1238}
