ded and use the specified module names.\n\nNow, putting it all together, I\'ll start with \'---\' followed by a linebreak. Then, each task will be listed with their respective modules and parameters. I\'ll use loops where necessary and conditionals for Task 1.\n\nI should double-check that all paths and variables are correctly referenced, like httpd_vhosts and httpd_vhosts_directory. Also, ensure that the creates attribute in Task 3 correctly points to the enabled site file.\n\nFinally, I\'ll review the YAML to make sure there are no syntax errors and that it adheres strictly to the user\'s instructions without any additions or omissions.\n</think>\n\n```\n---\n- name: Create docroot directories for each virtual host\n  file:\n    path: "{{ item.documentroot }}"\n    state: directory\n    mode: 0755\n  loop: "{{ httpd_vhosts | default([]) | list }}"\n  when:\n    - httpd_vhosts is defined\n    - item.documentroot is defined\n    - create_docroot | default(true)\n\n- name: Configure virtual host settings\n  template:\n    src: vhost_conf_template\n    dest: "{{ httpd_vhosts_directory }}/{{ item.name }}.conf"\n    mode: 0644\n  loop: "{{ httpd_vhosts | default([]) | list }}"\n\n- name: Enable virtual hosts on Debian systems\n  command: /usr/sbin/a2ensite "{{ item.name }}"\n  args:\n    chdir: /etc/apache2/sites-available\n  creates: /etc/apache2/sites-enabled/{{ item.name }}.conf\n  when: ansible_os_family == "Debian"\n  loop: "{{ httpd_vhosts | default([]) | list }}"\n  notify:\n    - Test httpd configuration validity\n    - Restart httpd\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-19T17:10:43.818036162Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 14078088915, 'load_duration': 91565800, 'prompt_eval_count': 459, 'prompt_eval_duration': 119005706, 'eval_count': 804, 'eval_duration': 13866097936, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--3943e1f1-452f-471f-b57e-797787dc4464-0' usage_metadata={'input_toke