nal, handling both states of apt_autostart_state.\n\nI should also ensure that the YAML is properly formatted without any comments or explanations, as per the user\'s request. Only the complete YAML playbook is needed, starting with \'---\' and a linebreak.\n\nI think I\'ve covered all the points. Now, I\'ll structure the playbook accordingly, making sure each task is correctly placed and adheres to the given instructions.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- import_tasks: assert.yml\n  run_once: true\n  delegate_to: localhost\n\n- name: Manage automatic service management\n  block:\n    if "ansible_pkg_mgr == \'apt\'":\n      if apt_autostart_state == "disabled":\n        copy:\n          content: "exit 101"\n          dest: /usr/sbin/policy-rc.d\n          mode: 755\n          owner: root\n          group: root\n      elif apt_autostart_state == "enabled":\n        file:\n          path: /usr/sbin/policy-rc.d\n          state: absent\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-19T17:39:28.851869271Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 11126632708, 'load_duration': 83238701, 'prompt_eval_count': 380, 'prompt_eval_duration': 87502522, 'eval_count': 653, 'eval_duration': 10954634663, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--a7965f9b-fa77-4869-a7c7-137d876047ec-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 380, 'output_tokens': 653, 'total_tokens': 1033}
