he playbook to make sure it\'s valid and adheres strictly to the given instructions, without any unnecessary elements or deviations from the specified tasks.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Create the RKE2 manifests directory\n  file:\n    path: /var/lib/rke2/manifests\n    state: directory\n    mode: 0755\n    owner: rancher\n    group: rancher\n\n- name: Copy kube-vip files to first server\n  copy:\n    src: "{{ lookup(\'fileglob\', \'templates/kube-vip-*\') | selectattr(\'exists\', \'bool\') }}"\n    dest: /var/lib/rke2/data/\n    remote_src: no\n    mode: 0644\n    owner: rancher\n    group: rancher\n\n- name: Copy kube-vip load balancer manifests to first server\n  condition: "{{ kube_vip_cloud_provider_enabled | default(\'no\') == \'yes\' }}"\n  copy:\n    src: "{{ lookup(\'fileglob\', \'templates/kube-vip-lb-*\') | selectattr(\'exists\', \'bool\') }}"\n    dest: /var/lib/rke2/data/\n    remote_src: no\n    mode: 0644\n    owner: rancher\n    group: rancher\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-19T18:40:05.413056473Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10092209015, 'load_duration': 69175299, 'prompt_eval_count': 368, 'prompt_eval_duration': 77919709, 'eval_count': 690, 'eval_duration': 9944186567, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--c4e727aa-3c2a-4305-80b1-f626147c2df2-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 368, 'output_tokens': 690, 'total_tokens': 1058}
