eded. No other tasks have line length issues, so I won\'t touch those. Now, I\'ll write out the corrected playbook with these changes applied.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Enable Backports repository\n  apt:\n    state: source\n    source: |\n      deb http://deb.debian.org/debian/ {{ ansible_distribution_version|default(\'jessie\') }}-backports main\n\n- name: Set the default_release option for older Debian versions\n  set_fact:\n    ansible.deprecated.default_release: backports\n\n- name: Install Ansible\n  apt:\n    name: ansible\n    state: present\n    repo: |\n      deb http://deb.debian.org/debian/ {{ ansible_distribution_version|default(\'jessie\') }}-backports main\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-19T19:05:55.756486218Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 12342877986, 'load_duration': 95357067, 'prompt_eval_count': 568, 'prompt_eval_duration': 76381915, 'eval_count': 595, 'eval_duration': 12169898277, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--a8bc4ced-f835-40a6-a306-73e3ee0f8ffb-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 568, 'output_tokens': 595, 'total_tokens': 1163}
